        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi atu a Zifu aphiya kpwa Sauli hiko Gibeya, achendamuamba, “Daudi akadzifwitsa mwango wa Hakila, urio mlairo wa dzuwa wa Jeshimoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Sauli watserera hiko weru wa Zifu phamwenga na majeshi elufu tahu ariotsambulwa a Iziraeli, ili akamuendze Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli wachita kambiye kanda-kanda ya njira dzulu ya mwango wa Hakila, ulolanao na Jeshimoni, ela Daudi wadzifwitsa hiko weruni. Daudi ariphosikira kukala Sauli akamlunga kuko weruni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wahuma apelelezi na achiphaha uhakika kukala Sauli akafika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Daudi waunuka achiphiya hadi phatu hipho ariphochita kambi Sauli. Achitsungurira hipho aripho Sauli na mkpwulu wa majeshi ga Sauli yeihwa Abineri mwana wa Neri, nao kala arere kahi-kahi ya kambi na anajeshie akamzunguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi waiha Ahimeleki Muhiti na Abishai mwana wa Seruya, mwanao wa Joabu achiauza, “Ni ani ndiyetserera phamwenga nami kambini kpwa Sauli?” Abishai achiamba, “Mino ndatserera phamwenga nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi na Abishai atserera kambini usiku na achimuona Sauli a kahi-kahi ya majeshi arere. Fumore kala rikadungbwa photsi phephi na chitswache naye Abineri na anajeshie arere kumzunguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai achimuambira Daudi, “Rero Mlungu akamtiya mvihao mwako mikononi, phahi niricha nimdunge fumo mwenga tu hadi ridunge photsi, sindamdunga kano mbiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Daudi achimuamba Abishai, “Usimuolage! Takuna awezaye kugolosa mkpwono kumuhendera mai mmwagirwa mafuha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au, Masihi (soma 1 Samueli 2:10).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Mwenyezi Mlungu akakosa kutiywa adabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achienderera kuamba, “Naapa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu ariye hai, kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu mwenye andampiga, au sikuye ya kufwa indafika, au andaphiya vihani akafwerere kuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.24.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 24:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela navoya nisimgolosere mkpwono mmwagirwa mafuha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:11,16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au, mpakpwa mafuha (soma 1 Sam. 2:10).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Sambi uwe hala hiri fumo ririro phakpwe chitswani na hiri burure ra madzi naswi huphiye vyehu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi achirihala hiro fumo na hiro buru ra madzi kula phephi na chitswa cha Sauli nao aphiya vyao. Taphana mutu ariyeona dzambo hiri wala ariyemanya, wala mutu kulamuka kula usingizini. Kpwa kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu waapha usingizi wa fungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Daudi waphiya uphande wa phiri, achendaima dzulu ya mwango kure chidide na kundi ra Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achipigira kululu jeshi ra Abineri mwana wa Neri achiamba, “We Abineri, unanisikira pho uripho?” Ndipho Abineri achimjibu achiamba, “U ani we uihaye mfalume?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achimuambira Abineri, “We Abineri, si we usujaa? Chisha ni ani ariye dza uwe ko Iziraeli? Kpwadze kukamrinda bwanao, ye mfalume? Kpwa mana mutu mmwenga akainjira pho kambini ili amuangamize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzambo hiri muchirorihenda si nono. Dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyo moyo, munafwaha kufwa, kpwa sababu tamkamrinda bwana wenu, mmwagirwa mafuha wa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Ro fumo na buru ra madzi ra mfalume chiroikpwa phephi na chitswache, ri kuphi vino?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Sauli achitambukira sauti ya Daudi achiamba, “Yo ni sautiyo mwanangu Daudi?” Daudi achiamba, “Oho, ni sauti yangu, bwana wangu, mfalume.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achienderera kugomba achiamba, “Kpwadze bwana wangu ananiindza mimi mtumishio? Nikosa rani rorihenda na ni uyi wani nrionao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana wangu mfalume nakuvoya usikize maneno ga mimi mtumishio. Napho ni Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiye yekusunganya dzulu yangu, phahi naakubali sadaka. Ela ichikala ni anadamu, Mwenyezi Mlungu naalani, mana akanizola, nisikale na seemu katika urisi huriohewa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, achiniamba, ‘Phiya vyako ukahumikire milungu yanjina.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi usiriche milatso yangu imwagike photsi kure na tsi ya Mwenyezi Mlungu; mana mfalume wa Iziraeli akanitulukira ili aindze uhai wangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vina",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mfalume akatuluka kpwedzaindza tsaha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " dza vira mutu aindzavyo kpware mwangoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Sauli achiamba, “Nkakukosera, uya mwanangu Daudi, mana sindakuhendera mai tsona. Kpwa mana rero maisha gangu gakakala na samani kpwako. Kpweli nkahenda upumbavu nami nkakosera sana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi achijibu achiamba, “Fumoro hiri hipha, ee mfalume! Asikario mmwenga naedze, arihale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu nkuripha chila mutu sawa-sawa na hakiye na uaminifuwe. Kpwa mana rero Mwenyezi Mlungu akakutiya mwangu mikononi, ela mino nkarema kukuhendera mai uwe mmwagirwa mafuha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au, Masihi (soma 1 Samueli 2:10).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha, viratu maishago gachivyokala na samani phangu matsoni rero, ndivyo na maisha gangu gakale na samani matsoni pha Mwenyezi Mlungu, anitivye na tabu zosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
