        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Sauli achimuambira Daudi, “Barikiwa mwanangu Daudi, undahenda mambo mabaha, tsona kpwa kpweli undaongokerwa.” Phahi, Daudi waphiya vyakpwe, Sauli naye achiuya kpwakpwe.",
